{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","女王之召"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤强大的卡莱尔先生协助作战。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个格子，在该位置唤醒卡莱尔先生协助作战。卡莱尔先生继承100%英雄属性，普通攻击对面前1格扇形范围内的所有敌人造成170% + 12% ATK伤害，且最大生命值额外提高45%，但每秒失去4%最大生命值。被召唤时，卡莱尔先生会释放“苦痛缚身”：对周围2格内所有敌人施加缠绕，被缠绕的目标无法行动，且每秒受到140% ATK伤害，持续2秒。再次使用本技能时，若卡莱尔先生已在场上，则使其回复至满血，并再次释放“苦痛缚身”。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":70,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":155,"end":163,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","卡莱尔先生的最大生命值额外提高60%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","卡莱尔先生的普通攻击伤害提高至175% + 12% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","卡莱尔先生的普通攻击伤害提高至180% + 12% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","卡莱尔先生的普通攻击伤害提高至185% + 12% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","大地的供奉"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身和卡莱尔先生的攻击速度。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","从大地中汲取力量，使自己和卡莱尔先生的攻击速度提升45 + 5点，持续8秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击速度提升50 + 5点。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":12,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","释放该技能后，卡莱尔先生的下一次普通攻击会替换为撼地锤击，对其周围2格内的所有敌人造成320% ATK伤害，该伤害额外获得15点生命汲取。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击速度提升55 + 5点。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":12,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","钻心利刺"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","普通攻击每隔几次就会获得一次伤害增强。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，瑟西娅与卡莱尔先生获得20 + 2点防御穿透。每当瑟西娅累计进行3次普通攻击，自己的下一次普通攻击将获得强化，伤害提高至220% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","被动获得的防御穿透提高至25 + 2点。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","强化后的普通攻击伤害提高至225% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","强化后的普通攻击伤害提高至230% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度，卡莱尔先生在场上存在期间进一步提升攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点攻击速度。且卡莱尔先生在场上存在期间，额外提升9点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高20点攻击速度。且卡莱尔先生在场上存在期间，额外提升12点攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高25点攻击速度。且卡莱尔先生在场上存在期间，额外提升15点攻击速度。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","荆棘审判"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","缠绕目标，并从目标身上吸取属性值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人施加强力缠绕，被缠绕的目标无法行动，且每秒受到60% ATK伤害，持续4秒。自身每秒会从受该技能影响的目标身上永久吸取1.5%的护甲与魔抗，并与卡莱尔先生共享吸取到的属性值。对于每个目标，最多只能通过该方式吸取8次属性值，该技能会优先对不处于免疫控制状态、且吸取次数还未达到上限的敌人使用。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次吸取属性时，还会同时吸取目标1点受愈。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","被缠绕的目标，每秒受到的伤害提高至70% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","被缠绕的目标，每秒受到的伤害提高至80% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“钻心利刺”触发所需的普通攻击次数降低。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“钻心利刺”触发所需的普通攻击次数降低-1次。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得500点初始能量。释放终极技能时，将会每秒永久吸取被缠绕敌人2%的基础属性，至多偷取相当于自身对应初始属性的50%，并与卡莱尔先生共享吸取到的属性值。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","荆棘妙乐"]]}